university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"This is a mission-specific community and support space. Review the center’s current contact and program information before planning a visit.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"iub-imu-interfaith-prayer-reflection-space","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Interfaith Prayer and Reflection Space","title":"Pause Quietly Between Classes","subtitle":"Individual reflection inside the Indiana Memorial Union","notes":"Use this quiet room for individual prayer, reflection, or a brief reset, and preserve the calm, inclusive purpose of the space.","short_summary":"A designated quiet room for personal spiritual or reflective needs.","evidence_claim":"The Indiana Memorial Union describes its Interfaith Prayer and Reflection Space as a quiet, inclusive area where individuals can address personal or spiritual needs.","source_url":"https://imu.indiana.edu/activities-services/services/index.html","source_title":"Services: Indiana Memorial Union","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located in the K.P. Williams Room on the IMU’s second floor. The official page lists the space as open daily from 8 a.m. to 10 p.m.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"iub-imu-student-involvement-leadership-center","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Student Involvement and Leadership Center","title":"Give a Student Organization Somewhere to Work","subtitle":"Gathering and collaboration space in the IMU","notes":"Bring organization planning to the center’s gathering space, or ask support staff how to connect a project with IU student involvement resources.","short_summary":"An IMU base for student groups, collaboration, and involvement support.","evidence_claim":"The India